This is the public certificate authority certificate for the K3s cluster
currently backing this deployment. It's a placeholder until it's replaced
with the certificate for MMS's own long-term K3s cluster.

Keeping it here lets developers reference it directly when setting up
kubectl locally. It is a public certificate, so there are no concerns about
committing it to git.

